HealerBeam calls AddLife before resetting its counter. AddLife increments intTankLife before reading objData.numLife; NPC Deactivate has already nulled objData. Source-derived behavior therefore keeps life1 and counter10 while aborting later Main.Run work. Do not replace this with an early dead-patient skip. These observations remain current-code execution plus source inference, with no original-runtime differential. The source digest and next-frame output are retained in source-audit.json and beam-null-probe.json.


